					],
					"usage_notes": "Vorpal Sword (SM+2) (18): swing 7d cutting (KYOS: 6d+2 cutting), Reach 2-3 or thrust 5d impaling (KYOS: 6d+2 impaling), Reach 2-3. This thrusting greatsword (LT70, B274) can be vorpalized by the wielder for 1 hour by taking a Concentrate maneuver and spending 1 FP. Once vorpalized, the sword will deal an additional 3d of follow-up (p. B105) cutting damage on neck swings. This additional damage causes no blunt trauma and no knockback. Additionally, the wielder of the weapon gets a +1 bonus to his weapon skill when making cutting swings that target necks."
				},
